        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is the shipping cost calculated for a household move from Bangalore to Pollachi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The shipping cost is based on the total weight of goods (up to 4000 kg), the volume occupied, the chosen truck size, distance, fuel surcharge, tolls, and any extra services such as packing or insurance. Our instant estimate tool factors in all these variables to give a transparent, all‑inclusive price.</p>
