        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical move from Bangalore to Pollachi take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The average transit time on the 850 km highway corridor is 12‑14 hours, depending on traffic and checkpoint clearances. Our route performance highlights show a 95% on‑time delivery rate, and we provide real‑time GPS tracking so you can monitor progress throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I store my belongings in a warehouse before they are delivered to Pollachi?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. We operate 24/7 CCTV‑monitored warehousing facilities in both Bangalore and Pollachi. Items can be stored securely for short‑term or long‑term periods, with optional climate control and insurance extensions available upon request.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What makes Shree Ashirwad’s packing system different from other movers?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our 7‑layer protective packaging combines high‑density bubble cushioning, multi‑ply corrugated sheets, sturdy wooden crates, stretch film, and anti‑vibration straps. This multi‑layer approach ensures maximum shock absorption and protection for fragile items, reducing the risk of damage compared to standard single‑layer packing.</p>
